OL,3,CChanges to the news service
OL,4,C
OL,5,FFromG19th AugustFour UK and world news
OL,6,Fpages are being supplied byGBBC News.
OL,8,FAs a consequence of this, there are
OL,9,Fchanges to the structure of the
OL,10,Fregional news service. Full details can
OL,11,Fbe found on pageG301.
OL,13,FNational and international news remains
OL,14,Findexed on pageG300.
OL,16,FThe most noticeable change is that our
OL,17,Fnews pages are now more suited to the
OL,18,Fconstraints of teletext, with stories
OL,19,Flimited to one to two pages.
OL,21,FAnd fromG22nd AugustFbusiness news is
OL,22,Favailable on pageG105.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
